    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 198,
        "text": "Hi, everyone. Thanks for coming to the museum today. I'm Mia, the study coordinator. This is a short study about how visitors allocate attention. Before we start, can I ask you a few questions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "41f66e222099d67efa1c7612f7ba3a73914d7cc0e2307e8320420361e7c5e49a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 205,
        "sourceEnd": 338,
        "text": "Sure. I'm Ben. I usually spend a lot of time reading the labels, but my friend Leo just walks quickly and looks at the big paintings.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f6f770a161aec12150759272d35959a666dd14900e7a577eb1501f2be15a501c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 345,
        "sourceEnd": 450,
        "text": "That's interesting. So, Ben, you focus on details, while Leo prefers a fast overview. Leo, is that right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5841d63f30d01a37f18615b8b0db537ea1d32ad8684a6e1294c741fa81b31fbd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 457,
        "sourceEnd": 559,
        "text": "Yes, mostly. Although I sometimes stop for a sculpture, I don't read much. I take a photo and move on.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "29d50dc41c2b8572a1d0f3408c92a9f0d862761ede88d1706b1be75590e68ae3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 566,
        "sourceEnd": 706,
        "text": "OK. Now, please wear this small eye-tracking glasses. They record where you look. The glasses are light, but they may feel strange at first.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "88bba95184e0f83dbd507cb81229ffe5ac6bc63c5e5532d55406f1dcb158b3c3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 713,
        "sourceEnd": 726,
        "text": "Do they hurt?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1ff5c510f72e3e0fef39752bdaeaa495771ebe91c06c2070755bfa013a2730e3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 734,
        "sourceEnd": 819,
        "text": "No, they don't. They just sit on your head. Please don't touch them during the visit.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "b18455ccb0a210c64ce4182ed58c8326810c9c567c8ca146357f2dced97722b2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 826,
        "sourceEnd": 848,
        "text": "How long is the visit?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "f8769bfa0b7135c30fc81a276832103cd8cccc02ecb02554916fd826234125e4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 855,
        "sourceEnd": 977,
        "text": "About forty minutes. You can walk anywhere, but please stay in the main galleries. The special exhibition is closed today.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5c721748790b292a97c0de716dc65bed5e7f46792e9271fcbabdf07dc50069f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 984,
        "sourceEnd": 1008,
        "text": "What are we looking for?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1cbea750132182c762798a74f0160473a7fe9500ef404e7efda5475979349097",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1015,
        "sourceEnd": 1168,
        "text": "We want to know which parts of a painting people look at first. Some people look at faces, and others look at colors or shapes. There is no right answer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "38a37d16dc5c5116ccac435c19fef28e107eb646e987a4a3128a569715a5c146",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1175,
        "sourceEnd": 1202,
        "text": "So, we just look naturally?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b240ece6439534e46ee9d2b9321a00873d0f44af84979212c87b69e03bcf7511",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1209,
        "sourceEnd": 1329,
        "text": "Exactly. After the visit, I'll ask you to draw a quick map of one painting from memory. That will show what you noticed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "8fec8966af8c76caecb9c3e9aabd433c5e42df3d1d1173cfa600ae8ed30253ef",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1336,
        "sourceEnd": 1360,
        "text": "I'm not good at drawing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "88ba1ce586aaba4926b12b3ccc65c878da0b90c53d4c5b5580a51165e410a695",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1367,
        "sourceEnd": 1546,
        "text": "Don't worry. It's not a test of art. It's just a memory task. Oh, and one more thing: please don't discuss the paintings with each other during the visit. You can talk afterwards.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "3dcb8a7705457612bdac7983b3a98d00e64def4d86b6133dd0674620cbaaa9aa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1553,
        "sourceEnd": 1575,
        "text": "Can we use our phones?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cc813a7ac2c9a06010e5abb5075e75530c838f93a59373eb14ef13837a47ecde",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1582,
        "sourceEnd": 1715,
        "text": "You can take photos, but please don't use social media inside the galleries. The light from screens can affect the eye-tracking data.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "8c47f33848e1fa49297597902cfb6bda79622cd17d96454dbe7348d4ec61dc3d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1722,
        "sourceEnd": 1776,
        "text": "Got it. So, we look, we don't talk, and we don't post.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "b7717bce40975631a781536631b7d20bb589052097878fae91c1597dbd3cc200",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1783,
        "sourceEnd": 1922,
        "text": "That's right. Any other questions? No? Great. Let's begin. Remember, the study is about attention, not about knowledge. Just be yourselves.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "ef396fa567475b28a44d4d92649f7eb00b60f22a9066fc213294adbbd38f64ae",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
